(914, 2, '2021-07-20 04:45:26', '2021-07-20 04:45:26', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Showcase is another page on the benyakiredits blog  It\'s a page that\'s almost wholly controlled by React Typescript and shows off widgets that I have been developing for other projects. Originally included in the benyakiredits repository, it has now been separated into its own. Notable features include a custom Webpack setup.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Showcase', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'showcase', '', '', '2021-07-20 04:45:28', '2021-07-20 04:45:28', '', 0, 'https://benyakiredits.com/?post_type=project&#038;p=914', 0, 'project', '', 0),
