haracters. Well, it may have been ‘look at how screwed up things are in this country’. I don’t hold a lot of books up to this standard, but this one had some promise that I felt it squandered.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'The Death of Rex Nhongo - C.B. George', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '194-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-12-20 02:17:21', '2019-12-20 02:17:21', '', 194, 'https://benyakiredits.com/uncategorized/194-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
