es her. So as long as it’s not in his field of view, he has no problem with the working class being exploited. And that’s why I was talking about the author being Gen X.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Comapny - Max Barry', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '215-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-12-20 14:32:41', '2019-12-20 14:32:41', '', 215, 'https://benyakiredits.com/uncategorized/215-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
