(316, 2, '2019-12-20 18:33:31', '2019-12-20 18:33:31', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>During these three part episode, Andy and I talk about Campusland: the Novel. The first two episodes are careful analysis of why we don\'t like it. Then it progresses with some select quotes and discussion about its overarching ideas and themes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/soundcloud {\"url\":\"https://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-93-campusland-pt-1\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"soundcloud\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-soundcloud wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-soundcloud wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-93-campusland-pt-1\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/soundcloud -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/soundcloud {\"url\":\"https://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-94-campusland-pt-2\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"soundcloud\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-soundcloud wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-soundcloud wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-94-campusland-pt-2\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/soundcloud -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/soundcloud {\"url\":\"https://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-95-campusland-pt-3\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"soundcloud\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-soundcloud wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-soundcloud wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-95-campusland-pt-3\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/soundcloud -->', 'Episode 93-95: Campusland', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '115-