(338, 2, '2019-12-20 19:06:51', '2019-12-20 19:06:51', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Andy leant me his friend Steve\'s copy of the novelization of Attack of the Clones, and oh boy. It was awful. I spend this entire episode tearing it down with him and guest host Steve.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/soundcloud {\"url\":\"https://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-73-attack-of-the\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"soundcloud\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-soundcloud wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-soundcloud wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-73-attack-of-the\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/soundcloud -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/soundcloud {\"url\":\"https://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-74-attack-of-the\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"soundcloud\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-soundcloud wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-soundcloud wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-74-attack-of-the\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/soundcloud -->', 'Episode 73-74: Attack of the Clones', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '336-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-12-20 19:06:51', '2019-12-20 19:06:51', '', 336, 'https://benyakiredits.com/uncategorized/336-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(339, 2, '2019-07-09 19:06:00', '2019-07-09 19:06:00', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We talk about Max Barry\'s Company. It has some high points on the level of the Office, but it has a lot of low and stupid points, especially the consumerist, anti-labor focus of the last third of the book (let\'s have a strike but call it something else because that\'s a dirty word).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/soundcloud {\"url\":\"https://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-71-company-pt-1\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"soundcloud\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-soundcloud wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-soundcloud wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-71-company-pt-1\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/soundcloud -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/soundcloud {\"url\":\"https://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-72-company-pt-2\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"soundcloud\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-soundcloud wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-soundcloud wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-72-company-pt-2\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/soundcloud -->', 'Episode 71-72: Company', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'company-2', '', '', '2021-03-13 04:50:10', '2021-03-13 04:50:10', '', 0, 'https://benyakiredits.com/?p=339', 0, 'post', '', 0),
