(341, 2, '2019-12-20 19:09:23', '2019-12-20 19:09:23', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We talk about Max Barry\'s Company. It has some high points on the level of the Office, but it has a lot of low and stupid points, especially the consumerist, anti-labor focus of the last third of the book (let\'s have a strike but call it something else because that\'s a dirty word).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/soundcloud {\"url\":\"https://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-71-company-pt-1\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"soundcloud\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-soundcloud wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-soundcloud wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-71-company-pt-1\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/soundcloud -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/soundcloud {\"url\":\"https://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-72-company-pt-2\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"soundcloud\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-soundcloud wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-soundcloud wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-72-company-pt-2\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/soundcloud -->', 'Episode 71-72: Company', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '339-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-12-20 19:09:23', '2019-12-20 19:09:23', '', 339, 'https://benyakiredits.com/uncategorized/339-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(342, 2, '2019-06-25 19:09:00', '2019-06-25 19:09:00', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let\'s get this out of the way. Yes, it\'s Die Hard. It\'s not quite as good as the movie if you want action, but it\'s better if you want some not particularly incisive social commentary. It\'s roughly equivalent to Crime and Punishment but a thriller and not a, you know, classic Russian novel.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/soundcloud {\"url\":\"https://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-69-nothing-lasts\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"soundcloud\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-soundcloud wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-soundcloud wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-69-nothing-lasts\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/soundcloud -->\n\n<!-- wp:core-embed/soundcloud {\"url\":\"https://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-70-tomorrow-never-dies\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"soundcloud\",\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-soundcloud wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-soundcloud wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://soundcloud.com/user-408474538/episode-70-tomorrow-never-dies\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:core-embed/soundcloud -->', 'Episode 69-70: Nothing Lasts Forever', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'nothing-lasts-forever-2', '', '', '2021-03-13 04:50:33', '2021-03-13 04:50:33', '', 0, 'https://benyakiredits.com/?p=342', 0, 'post', '', 0),
