(1222, 2, '2023-09-20 15:38:30', '2023-09-20 15:38:30', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I\'m kinda exhausted, so this post will probably be brief. I have gotten the frontend of the chat app to a decent place. I have the basics for the next few ideas, but it was taking me awhile to fix little things, then I decided I would like to have it another way, eventually go back to the first, and yeah... it was a lot of waffling. That usually means it\'s time to step back, work on something else, then come back when I have better ideas. When I was working on some major solo projects at my last job, I had the same experience. But anyway, you can see the code at its <a href=\"https://github.com/benyakirten/chat-app\">GitHub Repo.</a> My next step is to do some minor modifications (such as adding a good select box) to the blog (at least the one at benyakir writes, which is where you should be reading this).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'The first draft is done', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1220-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-09-20 15:38:30', '2023-09-20 15:38:30', '', 1220, 'https://benyakiredits.com/?p=1222', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1209, 2, '2023-09-12 16:17:42', '2023-09-12 16:17:42', '', 'Screenshot-2023-09-12-at-10.17.00-AM-1', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'screenshot-2023-09-12-at-10-17-00-am-1', '', '', '2023-09-12 16:17:42', '2023-09-12 16:17:42', '', 1199, 'https://benyakiredits.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Screenshot-2023-09-12-at-10.17.00-AM-1.png', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0),
